            <formatted-text>
              <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#7f7f7f' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='11'>April was marked as a crunch month where we can observe that churn was more than the inflow, possibly could be because of no employment during Spring break and boost of expenses during the break</run>
